  "prefLabel": "Alc 102.05 Master licensed alcohol and drug counselor (MLADC)",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Alc 102.05 “Master licensed alcohol and drug counselor (MLADC)” means “master licensed alcohol and drug counselor” as defined in RSA 330-C:2, XV namely “an individual licensed by the office of professional licensure and certification to practice substance use, mental health, and co-occurring disorder counseling who meets the qualifications set forth in this chapter.”\n\nSource. #8169, eff 9-21-04; ss by 9417, eff 3-14-09; ss by #14585, eff 6-1-26",
